&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years of professional experience working in the publishing industry, including a network of connections and a focus in one or more of the following areas:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Literary and talent agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Large traditional publishing houses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencer, celebrity, and content creator publishing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working as an acquisitions editor, literary agent, or other sales and business development roles within the publishing industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to collaborate, and execute on strategic plans that get data driven results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills: adept at speaking and presenting to small and large groups, speaking to the press, and has the ability to represent Kickstarter in a positive light at industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of what makes projects within their category of focus standout – ability to assess quality, innovation, creativity, and clarity of presentation when reviewing a campaign independently.&lt;/li&gt;
