&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve our mobile design system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide an international design perspective within our product org.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively partner with our research team to conduct and analyze user research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with teams across Kickstarter as the company works toward building a mature ecosystem that serves our community of Creators and Backers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with partners on cross-functional teams to ensure alignment where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have solid professional experience leading design for mobile apps across iOS and Android platforms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your portfolio shows a proven track record of designing thoughtful, engaging, and highly usable mobile experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are knowledgeable of platform-specific design patterns and conventions across iOS and Android.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience designing experiences for consumers in North America, Europe, and Asia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience designing with international privacy laws and regulations in mind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing for commerce based companies with international checkout experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an excellent communicator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to consistently frame, explain and support your design decisions with peers and stakeholders, as well as deeply understand their feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strengths in information architecture, interaction design, and visual design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable using both formal and informal methods to gather and give feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with design programs like Figma, and are comfortable prototyping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You empathize with our Creator and Backer communities and recognize how both contribute to Kickstarter’s ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You recognize the challenges of the creative process and bringing projects to life.&lt;/li&gt;
